<title>USA: ITT gets $509.9 mln U.S. defense contract.</title>
<headline>ITT gets $509.9 mln U.S. defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp has received a $509.9 million U.S. defense contract to build military radios, the Army said.</p>
<p>The contract represented a victory for ITT over General Dynamics Corp, which has in the past also supplied the Single Channel Ground and Airborne Radio Systems (SINGCGARS) to the U.S. military.</p>
</text>
